WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:01.346
(pounding)

00:00:01.346 --> 00:00:02.179
- Ow, ow.

00:00:02.179 --> 00:00:05.012
(upbeat dub step)

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.063
- I'm going to give you an apple.

00:00:09.063 --> 00:00:12.434
Rip it in half with your bare hands.

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:14.138
- I've never tried
ripping an apple in half

00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:15.121
with my bare hands.

00:00:15.121 --> 00:00:16.529
(laughs)

00:00:16.529 --> 00:00:18.058
- I think you're underestimating

00:00:18.058 --> 00:00:19.634
how weak I am.
- Yeah.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:20.467
- You can't.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.300
- No way.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.383
Not here.
- Can't be done.

00:00:24.396 --> 00:00:25.239
No.

00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:27.314
- Is this what we're doing today?

00:00:27.314 --> 00:00:28.604
(laughs) What?

00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:30.203
- This is not going to go well.

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:31.899
(bell rings)

00:00:31.899 --> 00:00:32.932
- Challenge accepted.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.822
- I'm thinking that I'm
going to try to make

00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:36.797
some incisions with this dud right here.

00:00:36.797 --> 00:00:38.005
- I think I'm going to
try to use my nails.

00:00:38.005 --> 00:00:39.714
- You're not supposed
to use your nails okay?

00:00:39.714 --> 00:00:40.754
- You can put your fingers...

00:00:40.754 --> 00:00:41.666
- Like at the top?

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.298
- Yeah, where the holes are.

00:00:43.298 --> 00:00:44.907
- That's not working though.

00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:46.986
- So there's a little bit of a hole.

00:00:46.986 --> 00:00:48.714
- Oh wow, that's quite the noise.

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:49.610
- Can I just crush it?

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.596
I feel like crushing it is easier.

00:00:51.596 --> 00:00:52.440
- Oh my God.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.880
Started talking like a lumberjack.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.771
(laughs)

00:00:54.771 --> 00:00:55.839
I'm getting one here.

00:00:55.839 --> 00:00:56.672
- You got it Sasha?

00:00:56.672 --> 00:00:58.584
- No. (laughs)

00:00:58.584 --> 00:01:00.624
- I heard a crack.

00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:02.368
- I've never heard of this, why?

00:01:02.368 --> 00:01:03.804
In what scenario would you need this?

00:01:03.804 --> 00:01:05.255
(groans)
(laughs)

00:01:05.255 --> 00:01:06.273
- Thighs of steel.

00:01:06.273 --> 00:01:07.573
- This is hurting me. (laughs)

00:01:07.573 --> 00:01:08.659
- Um yeah, she's like,

00:01:08.659 --> 00:01:10.212
Jesus Christ. (laughs)

00:01:10.212 --> 00:01:11.045
- Can I step on it?

00:01:11.045 --> 00:01:12.462
- Oh my God if you get this.

00:01:12.462 --> 00:01:13.915
Oh my God.

00:01:13.915 --> 00:01:14.748
- Ha ha!

00:01:14.748 --> 00:01:17.682
Hunger was a motivating factor.

00:01:17.682 --> 00:01:18.749
- Rip an apple in half

00:01:18.749 --> 00:01:19.962
with your bare hands.

00:01:19.962 --> 00:01:21.547
