00:01:23.764 --> 00:01:25.042
and then we're gonna like

00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:26.146
twist and pull.

00:01:26.146 --> 00:01:28.646
So let's see if I can do this.

00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:31.554
- He's stronger than I am.

00:01:31.554 --> 00:01:33.106
- I know. (laughs).

00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:36.682
