way is to put your finger

00:01:36.682 --> 00:01:39.154
in-between, like that, in the middle

00:01:39.154 --> 00:01:41.082
and then just stomp it on the...

00:01:41.082 --> 00:01:42.356
- I'm not breaking my finger
- Ow!

00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:43.248
- for this.

00:01:43.248 --> 00:01:44.539
(screams in pain)

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:45.706
- Don't do it!

00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:49.375
- Oh my God!
- Oh my God!

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.466
- The first step, remove all stickers.

00:01:52.466 --> 00:01:53.299
How'd he grip it? He like...

00:01:53.299 --> 00:01:55.466
- He gripped it like this.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:59.889
- Oh my God, please do that.

00:01:59.889 --> 00:02:01.336
Are you still recording?
- Ow!

00:02:01.336 --> 00:02:02.608
- Grip at the bottom right?

00:02:02.608 --> 00:02:03.824
- I'm about to break some nails.

00:02:03.824 --> 00:02:05.313
- I'm doing the palm pry again.

00:02:05.313 --> 00:02:06.592
- Oh!
- Oh my God you did it!

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:07.825
Yay!

00:02:07.825 --> 00:02:08.825
- Oh my God.

00:02:09.949 --> 00:02:11.225
- Yes!
- Okay well

00:02:11.225 --> 00:02:12.962
not completely in half but...

00:02:12.962 --> 00:02:17.192
(pounding)
(laughs)

00:02:17.192 --> 00:02:18.576
- You did it look!
- I did it!

00:02:18.576 --> 00:02:20.659
(laughs)

00:02:22.122 --> 00:02:22.955
- It's just

00:02:22.955 --> 00:02:25.113
