00:02:50.363 --> 00:02:51.196
- Absolutely not.

00:02:51.196 --> 00:02:52.029
- No.

00:02:52.029 --> 00:02:53.454
If there's alcohol involved, maybe.

00:02:53.454 --> 00:02:54.287
But, no.

00:02:54.287 --> 00:02:55.316
But you know what?

00:02:55.316 --> 00:02:58.105
On a crazy drunken night
if there's an apple nearby

00:02:58.105 --> 00:02:59.363
I'm going to tell people.

00:02:59.363 --> 00:03:01.427
I can rip that apple
apart with my bare hands.

00:03:01.427 --> 00:03:03.469
